Job Title: Insights & Analytics Practice Lead (Remote)
Location: Remote (USA Candidate only)
Duration: 6 Months

Interview: Virtual
Job Description
We are seeking an experienced Insights & Analytics Practice Lead to build and grow a Life Sciences analytics practice supporting pharmaceutical, biotechnology, medical device, and healthcare organizations. This role combines practice leadership, strategic consulting, business development, advanced analytics, and client delivery.
Key Responsibilities
•	Define practice strategy, service offerings, and growth plans.
•	Lead analytics teams, consultants, data scientists, and delivery engagements.
•	Advise executives on analytics strategy, digital transformation, and data-driven decisions.
•	Lead commercial analytics initiatives, including sales effectiveness, omnichannel analytics, market access, forecasting, and patient services.
•	Oversee AI, machine learning, predictive analytics, and Generative AI solutions.
•	Develop data and technology strategies using platforms such as Snowflake, Databricks, Azure, AWS, Veeva, and Salesforce.
•	Manage practice P&L, revenue growth, utilization, and client satisfaction.
•	Drive business development, client relationships, proposals, SOWs, and account expansion.
Required Qualifications
•	Bachelor's degree in Business, Analytics, Computer Science, Life Sciences, or a related field.
•	12+ years of experience in life sciences analytics, consulting, commercial operations, or data strategy.
•	5+ years leading consulting practices, analytics teams, or large delivery organizations.
•	Strong understanding of pharmaceutical commercialization and commercial operations.
•	Experience managing executive relationships and multi-million-dollar consulting engagements.
•	Proven ability to build teams, develop service offerings, and grow business.
Preferred Qualifications
•	Master's degree or MBA.
•	Experience with firms such as IQVIA, Accenture, ZS, Deloitte, Cognizant, or EVERSANA.
•	Knowledge of AI, machine learning, and advanced analytics platforms.
•	Experience in commercial, medical affairs, market access, and patient support functions.
•	Strong executive presentation and thought leadership skills.
Technical Skills
•	Analytics: Python, R, SQL, SAS, machine learning, Generative AI
•	Data Platforms: Snowflake, Databricks, Azure, AWS
•	Visualization: Power BI, Tableau, ThoughtSpot, Qlik
•	Life Sciences: Veeva CRM, Veeva Network, Salesforce Data Cloud, IQVIA Data Assets, Komodo Health, Symphony Health

